{"unit_id":"Nicholas023__vision-exp-tile#feature-1","repo":"Nicholas023/vision-exp-tile","commit":"99f3c26bdc89cd0f392c3238304c5cfea8ffded4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 的功能「网格切图」：把大图按网格拆成带坐标和编号的小块，并生成全局 overview。调用切图工具并提供图片路径，可调整块大小、交叠和输出格式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:351-370","src/tile-engine.js:125-149"]}
